Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='fencelayers', at=datetime(2026, 9, 1, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="The remaining fence layers: edit-guard hook, the alarm-only nix-store trust gate, safe-push's allowlist", body="Measured: `Read(<glob>)` scoping IS enforced; `Bash()`/`Edit()` arg scoping is NOT. Remaining layers, each live-fire tested: edit-guard hook (backstop, not the fence); nix-store trust gate (reports non-allowlisted tree changes pre-run; ALARM-ONLY since 09-01 — it used to restore them, and the only writer it caught was the main session); safe-push allowlist (the agent's stores + `state.json`, nothing rendered; no code path, since code reaches master through the train alone).", rationale='Measured, each layer live-fire tested. The trust gate has been alarm-only since 2026-09-01: it used to restore changes, and the only writer it caught was the main session.', supersedes=()))